  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased security of the arms-UNDP-ALB-00133814</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this Project is the reconstruction of the SALW Storage sites in the Regional Police Directorates of Lezha, Vlora, and Kukes. The proposed interventions will significantly increase the safekeeping and management of SALW and prevent their undesired access, misuse, deterioration and damage. A consolidated PSSM training on SALW for the personnel of the 3 FAAE facilities supported by this proposal will also be provided.</narrative>
  </description>
